-2] in TESTS:\n            m = re.match(r\"([\\d.]+)\", c[-1])\n            if m: out[c[-2]] = float(m.group(1))\n    return out\n\ndef table(d: str, base: str):\n    \"\"\"Build and print a summary table for a single directory of results.\n\n    Collects per-arm results across all markdown files in `ROOT/<d>`, computing\n    the mean value per test for each"}